        "notes": "13 viaduct bents per side at a placeholder 100 ft spacing. Nothing about this rhythm is sourced - it exists so the approach reads as a supported viaduct rather than a floating slab, and so a viewer can see there is structure between the anchorage and the street. The bents stop at z = 0 (mean high water) rather than at ground, because no source gives the ground profile under either approach. See OQ-020.",
