        "notes": "track_2 continued from the anchorage cable point, through the anchorage, across the brooklyn approach to the abutment. The four tracks have to reach the subway portals, so ending them at the anchorage was a modelling artefact rather than a statement about the bridge. The transverse centreline remains the OQ-010 placeholder and the approach trackwork alignment is unregistered; see OQ-020.",
